WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:06.960
chuckle what do you think about when you
don't feel like getting after it you

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:15.750
know I put this out the other day and I
think it's important all right

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:26.010
so rome wasn't built in a day we all
know that everyone's hears that but rome

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:36.059
also didn't fall apart overnight either
it took hundreds of years for Rome to

00:00:36.059 --> 00:00:45.600
reach its peak but it also took time
hundreds of years for Rome to decay and

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:57.170
fall apart and that is representative of
life because you don't achieve

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:08.060
worthwhile goals quickly or easily they
take time they take struggle they take

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:19.200
relentless pursuit day in and day out
that's what it takes but also things

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:27.420
don't usually fall apart quickly either
at least at first it's it's a slow

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:33.990
process a little slip here a little
setback over there

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:46.560
a little wearing down of discipline and
will over time that's the thing success

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:57.229
and failure are generally slow processes
either slowly building things up or

00:01:57.229 --> 00:02:01.969
gradually tearing them down

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:13.660
and that's why I say you've got to pay
attention you have to watch you have to

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:27.670
watch every single second because those
seconds they turn into minutes then

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:40.570
minutes turn into hours and hours turn
into days and days turn in to years and

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:51.400
so that second that second that just
went by that counted and so did that

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:58.240
second and so did that one
and in those precious seconds you are

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:09.760
either building or you're decaying you
are either gaining ground or you were

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:19.350
losing ground in that second and in
every second

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:25.819
every second counts

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:35.610
so make every second count

